  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Silver Jewellery planning grant - BWA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Silversmide - Planeringsbidrag - BWA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Genom detta planeringsbidrag ska svenska Smycken &amp; Sm&#xe5;tt och          botswanska Motanka Jewellery fokusera p&#xe5; utbyte av designid&#xe9;er,       produktion och f&#xf6;rs&#xe4;ljing av framf&#xf6;r allt smycken i Sverige och       Botswana samt p&#xe5; andra markander. Parterna str&#xe4;var ocks&#xe5; efter att    skapa en plattform f&#xf6;r kulturutbyten f&#xf6;r hantverkare och studenter i  de b&#xe5;da l&#xe4;nderna.Parterna ska ta fram en gemensam plan.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this planning grant, the Swedish &quot;Smycken &amp; Sm&#xe5;tt&quot;  and       Botswana Motanka Jewellery will focus on the exchange of design       ideas, production and marketing of mainly jewelry in Sweden and       Botswana, as well as in other markets. The partners also strive to    create a platform for cultural exchanges for craftsmen and students   in both countries.Together they will form an activity plan.</narrative>
  </description>
